.SS Adding your own plugin
.IP "1." 3
\f[CR]cp \-r plugins/example plugins/myplugin\f[R]
.IP "2." 3
Rename \f[CR]example\f[R] → \f[CR]myplugin\f[R] in the source files
.IP "3." 3
Add \f[CR]plugin_load(&plugin_myplugin, 1)\f[R] to
\f[CR]src/config.h\f[R] (or load it from your user config \[em] see
Configuration)
.IP "4." 3
Build with \f[CR]make\f[R]
.PP
See \f[CR]plugins/example/README.md\f[R] for the full recipe and the
plugin contract.
.SS Out\-of\-tree plugins
Keep your plugin set anywhere on disk and point the build at it:
.IP
.EX
make PLUGINS_DIR=$HOME/my\-hed\-plugins
.EE
.PP
